  "question": {
    "text": "The torque of a force $5 \\hat{i}+3 \\hat{j}-7 \\hat{k}$ about the origin is $\\tau$. If the force acts on a particle whose position vector is $2 \\hat{i}+2 \\hat{j}+\\hat{k}$, then the value of $\\tau$ will be :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$11 \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}+19 \\hat{\\mathrm{j}}-4 \\hat{\\mathrm{k}}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$-11 \\hat{\\mathbf{i}}+9 \\hat{\\mathbf{j}}-16 \\hat{\\mathrm{k}}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$-17 \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}+19 \\hat{\\mathrm{j}}-4 \\hat{\\mathrm{k}}$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$17 \\hat{i}+9 \\hat{j}+16 \\hat{k}$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given that torque, $\\vec{\\tau}=5 \\hat{i}+3 \\hat{j}-7 \\hat{k}$<br />Position vector, $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{r}}=2 \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}++2 \\hat{\\mathrm{j}}+\\hat{\\mathrm{k}}$<br />$\\begin{aligned} & \\vec{\\tau}=\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{r}} \\times \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{F}}=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}\\mathrm{i} & \\mathrm{j} & \\mathrm{k} \\\\ 2 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -7\\end{array}\\right| \\\\ & =\\hat{\\mathrm{i}}(-14-3)-\\hat{\\mathrm{j}}(-14-5)+\\hat{\\mathrm{k}}(6-10) \\\\ & =-17 \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}+19 \\hat{\\mathrm{j}}-4 \\hat{\\mathrm{k}}\\end{aligned}$"
  }
}